WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:01.751
♪ (MELLOW MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:04.754
DREW MICHAEL:
I have a hard time with people,
 so, here we go.

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:05.922
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

00:00:06.005 --> 00:00:08.007
Social media has changed
the way we think,

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:09.968
the way we process
our own language,

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:11.136
how we sound.

00:00:11.219 --> 00:00:12.721
I remember in the '16 election,

00:00:12.804 --> 00:00:15.557
they were talking about The Rock
maybe running for president.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:16.850
I said that to a friend,
I was like,

00:00:16.933 --> 00:00:18.935
"Yo, I heard The Rock
might run for president."

00:00:19.018 --> 00:00:21.563
My buddy was like,
"Is The Rock a democrat?"

00:00:21.646 --> 00:00:23.648
And I was like, "Dude,
listen to the sentence...

00:00:23.732 --> 00:00:26.192
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

00:00:26.401 --> 00:00:27.444
...that you just said."

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:29.154
"Is The Rock a democrat?"

00:00:29.237 --> 00:00:31.781
I don't know,
he's a fake wrestling character.

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:35.285
I don't know where he stands
on healthcare.

00:00:35.493 --> 00:00:37.036
"Is The Rock a democrat?"

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.705
I don't know,
did the yellow Power Ranger

00:00:38.788 --> 00:00:40.081
support the war in Iraq?

00:00:40.165 --> 00:00:41.833
What the fuck are we
talking about?

00:00:41.916 --> 00:00:43.668
(LAUGHTER)

00:00:45.086 --> 00:00:47.213
Where does Mickey Mouse
stand on abortion?

00:00:47.297 --> 00:00:48.173
I don't know.

00:00:48.673 --> 00:00:51.009
Is he a second trimester
or before kind of mouse?

00:00:51.092 --> 00:00:52.051
Or more like a hardline...

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:53.845
(MIMICS MICKEY) "Life
begins at conception, folks!"

